<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Holophane raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Holophane raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Russell Leavitt upgraded Holophane Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- cited strong second quarter earnings of $0.34 a share, above analyst's estimate of $0.31.</p>
<p>-- in summary report cited strong sales and order levels, reengineering actions, and the capture of a new retail account with Orchard Stores.</p>
<p>-- said expects 1997 earnings to be &quot;at least&quot; $1.56 a share, up from a previous forecast of $1.53.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/2 at 21.</p>
</text>
